{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Boole代数"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Boole 代数"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Boole 代数是经典逻辑的"},{"Local":{"url":"语法–语义对偶","text":"语义"}},{"Plain":". 如 Boole 代数中的积 (交) 是逻辑与 $X\\wedge Y$, 指数 $Y^X$ 是逻辑蕴含 $X\\Rightarrow Y$, 赋值映射是推理法则 $(X\\Rightarrow Y)\\wedge X \\leq Y$ 等等.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>Boole 代数是具有补运算的"},{"Local":{"url":"分配格","text":"分配格"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Boole 代数与 "},{"Local":{"url":"Boole环","text":"Boole 环"}},{"Plain":"可以相互转化.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Stone对偶","text":"Stone 对偶"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}